{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5465136621734271342,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Set up environment on Mac OS",
      "source_hash": 155440785002065436,
      "context_hash": 7308725282981306251,
      "translation": "Mac OS에서 환경 설정하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848491Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Mac support is still experimental.",
      "source_hash": 16271061891460873975,
      "context_hash": 1216116223249709751,
      "translation": "**Mac 지원은 아직 실험적입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848491Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Submit bugs if you experience issues.**",
      "source_hash": 5214505043920654509,
      "context_hash": 2306090882766933593,
      "translation": "문제가 발생하면 버그를 제보해 주십시오.**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848491Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Run terminal.",
      "source_hash": 17360764307843886815,
      "context_hash": 11501422921385119269,
      "translation": "터미널을 실행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848492Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Install homebrew (if haven't already) following instructions from [here](https://brew.sh):",
      "source_hash": 16897877145968026420,
      "context_hash": 16015655063898595391,
      "translation": "(아직 설치하지 않았다면) [여기](https://brew.sh)의 안내에 따라 homebrew를 설치하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848492Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Install clang-17 compiler (make sure that the version is not older than 15, otherwise it will not compile):",
      "source_hash": 17927156180220868130,
      "context_hash": 14863231585008610531,
      "translation": "clang-17 컴파일러를 설치하십시오(버전이 15보다 낮으면 컴파일되지 않으므로 반드시 확인하십시오).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Clang": "Clang",
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848492Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Consider making environment changes permanent:",
      "source_hash": 9018117585200922231,
      "context_hash": 4882002398598255248,
      "translation": "환경 변경 사항을 영구적으로 적용하는 것을 고려하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848492Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Build release version of google [benchmark library](https://github.com/google/benchmark#installation).",
      "source_hash": 1673382453000849068,
      "context_hash": 15809587331577330056,
      "translation": "google [벤치마크 라이브러리](https://github.com/google/benchmark#installation)의 릴리스 버전을 빌드하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "benchmark library": "벤치마크 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848492Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "It doesn't matter which compiler you use to build it.",
      "source_hash": 18351968480203970138,
      "context_hash": 8761235225738572864,
      "translation": "빌드에 어떤 컴파일러를 사용하든 상관없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848492Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:9/seg:2",
      "source": "Install google benchmark library with:",
      "source_hash": 4935009703652577365,
      "context_hash": 7287056698734359214,
      "translation": "다음 명령으로 Google Benchmark 벤치마크 라이브러리를 설치하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Google Benchmark": "Google Benchmark",
        "benchmark library": "벤치마크 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:25:32.846189Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Go to any lab and check if local lab builds are working.",
      "source_hash": 401005919009254094,
      "context_hash": 17752556190791950794,
      "translation": "아무 실습으로 이동하여 로컬 실습 빌드가 제대로 작동하는지 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "lab": "실습"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848492Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "You can find the CMake commands [here](GetStarted.md#how-to-build-lab-assignments).",
      "source_hash": 8484345686837977753,
      "context_hash": 4293119388230509723,
      "translation": "CMake 명령은 [여기](GetStarted.md#how-to-build-lab-assignments)에서 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CMake": "CMake",
        "commands": "명령"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848493Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "(Optional) Install [ninja](https://github.com/ninja-build).",
      "source_hash": 13914461345393832342,
      "context_hash": 17787637466178827261,
      "translation": "(선택 사항) [ninja](https://github.com/ninja-build)를 설치하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848493Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "You can use it to build labs by passing `-G Ninja` to the CMake invocation.",
      "source_hash": 9954407835184041739,
      "context_hash": 7437170711698066064,
      "translation": "CMake를 호출할 때 `-G Ninja`를 전달하면 ninja로 실습을 빌드할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CMake": "CMake"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:15:59.848493Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}